<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 27     Sept 26	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.740     239.890     237.040    1.56 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.330     301.300     303.640   -0.76 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.000     157.680     165.490   -4.53 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.720	46.612	48.410   -3.49 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  375.700     373.980     366.280    2.57 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.830     140.550     147.886   -4.77 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.801	15.766	14.975    5.52 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  217.170     216.880     230.135   -5.63 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.879	 1.875	 1.939   -3.09 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.552	 1.550	 1.575   -1.46 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.920     191.680     206.030   -6.85 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
